{
  "$comment": "Conformance suite for which app versions a license's release access covers, read from the license token's l:rel:until (seconds since epoch), l:rel:major and l:rel:upto claims. The Moonbase backend and every SDK must agree on every case. A token with none of the claims covers every version. A version that can't be read is not checked, so it counts as covered. Reading a version: an optional leading v, two to four numbers (missing ones are 0, a fourth is ignored), and any -pre-release or +build suffix dropped.",
